    "en": {
      "title": "Slope stabilisation",
      "h1": "MR / Pneumatic and hydraulic machines",
      "description": "Marini’s MR series is a collection of compact rigs specially designed for foundation work and slope stabilisation. The series is developed to meet challenging…",
