        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Marini’s MR series is a collection of compact rigs specially designed for foundation work and slope stabilisation. The series is developed to meet challenging conditions and deliver high performance in complex environments."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Most of the models below can be both hydraulic and pneumatic. The pneumatic models are generally lighter. Many of these rigs can also be dismantled into smaller parts for transport."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Each model offers different stroke lengths, feed forces, pull-back force and rotation torque depending on specific requirements."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "See the table a little further down for the technical specifications."
